+"""Rollout activity metrics for async (separate_async) training.
+
+The agent loop stamps each prompt group with ``rollout_start_ts`` / ``rollout_end_ts`` (wall clock, all n
+samples of the group). The replay buffer collects the stamps at every TransferQueue sync, and the trainer
+reduces them over the wall-clock window between two weight syncs.
